ffs[i] and b->coeffs[i] are always accessed within the declared coefficient array bounds for all iterations.","supporting_evidence":[{"source_path":"/home/girish/thesis-repos/mlkem-native/mlkem/src/poly.c","locator":"mlk_poly_add loop header","excerpt":"for (i = 0; i < MLKEM_N; i++)","supports_claim":"The loop covers exactly the 256 coefficient indices in order.","confidence":"high"},{"source_path":"/home/girish/thesis-repos/mlkem-native/mlkem/src/poly.h","locator":"mlk_poly typedef","excerpt":"typedef struct
